{"quest":{"line_id":"14010534","line_type":"5","order":548,"title":{"cn":"新萨洛克兰","en":"A New Sal'thorin","jp":"新生サロクディア","kr":"새로운 셀로클랜드"},"description":{"cn":"没有矮人的帮助，席蕾负责的平民区修缮工作困难重重。你们帮她分担了部分工作，并替她向沙利叶表达了与矮人合作的想法。","en":"With no help from the dwarves, Xera struggles to restore the commoners' district. You help with part of the work and tell Ravion about Xera's idea to partner with the dwarves.","jp":"ドワーフの協力が得られず、セレが担当している平民街の修復は難航していた。あなたたちは作業を分担し、サリエにドワーフとの協力を提案した。","kr":"드워프들의 도움 없이 시레이가 맡은 평민 지역 복구 작업은 힘들 것 같다. 시레이의 일을 도와준 뒤, 시레이 대신 사리에에게 드워프와 협력하겠다는 뜻을 전했다."},"reputation_camp_id":"402","reputation_camp_title":{"cn":"萨罗克兰","en":"Sal'thorin","jp":"サロクディア","kr":"셀로클랜드"},"route":"#/season-4/daily/14010534","assets":[{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010534:1:1"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234250"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010534:1:2"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234260"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010534:1:3"},{"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_14010534:1:3"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234280"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010534:1:4"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234290"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010534:1:5"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234300"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010534:1:6"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234310"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010534:1:7"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234320"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010534:1:8"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234330"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234340"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_14010534:1:9"},{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234350"}],"tasks":[{"task_id":"1","steps":[{"step_id":"1","pre_step_ids":[],"objective_title":{"cn":"与沙利叶对话","en":"Talk to Ravion","jp":"サリエと話す","kr":"사리에와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"与沙利叶对话，看看他是否需要帮助。","en":"Talk to Ravion and see if he needs any help.","jp":"サリエと話し、力になれることがあるか尋ねよう。","kr":"사리에와 대화해 도움이 필요한지 물어보자."}},{"step_id":"2","pre_step_ids":["1"],"objective_title":{"cn